stream
BT /F2 16 Tf 54 723 Td (Whistleblowing Policy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 701 Td (Policy code: POL-CORP-004. Owner: Company Secretary, Legal and Compliance \(CC-5200\). Effective) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 688 Td (date: 1 June 2022. Version: 1.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 663 Td (1. Purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 641 Td (Meridian Instruments Ltd is committed to conducting its business honestly and with integrity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 628 Td (This policy encourages employees and others working for Meridian to report genuine concerns) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 615 Td (about wrongdoing as early as possible, explains how to do so, and describes the protection) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 602 Td (available to those who raise concerns in good faith.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 577 Td (2. Who this policy applies to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 555 Td (This policy applies to all employees, officers, contractors, agency workers, interns and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 542 Td (consultants at all Meridian sites: Leeds, Rotterdam, Austin and Penang.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 517 Td (3. What to report) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 495 Td (Whistleblowing is the disclosure of information relating to suspected wrongdoing or danger at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 482 Td (work. Examples include:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 460 Td (- criminal activity, including fraud, theft, bribery and corruption;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 447 Td (- failure to comply with a legal or regulatory obligation;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 434 Td (- danger to health and safety, including unsafe handling of calibration gases or test) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 421 Td (   equipment;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 408 Td (- damage to the environment;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 395 Td (- falsification of product test or certification records;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 382 Td (- breaches of our Code of Conduct \(POL-CORP-001\) or financial controls;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 369 Td (- deliberate concealment of any of the above.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 356 Td (Personal grievances about your own employment terms, such as a dispute about pay or a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 343 Td (disagreement with your manager, should normally be raised under the Disciplinary and Grievance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 330 Td (Procedure \(POL-HR-040\) instead.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 305 Td (4. How to raise a concern) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 283 Td (In most cases you should first raise your concern with your line manager. If you do not feel) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 270 Td (able to do so, or you believe your manager is involved, you can use any of the following) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 257 Td (channels:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 235 Td (- email the ethics mailbox at ethics@meridian-instruments.example, which is read only by the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 222 Td (   Company Secretary and the Head of Internal Audit;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 209 Td (- call the independent Clearline Ethics hotline on 0800 915 4420, available 24 hours a day,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 196 Td (   which accepts anonymous reports;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 183 Td (- write to the Company Secretary at Meridian Instruments Ltd, Leeds headquarters, marked) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 170 Td (   "Private and confidential";) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 157 Td (- if your concern relates to a member of the executive team, contact the Chair of the Audit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 144 Td (   Committee through the Company Secretary.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 131 Td (Colleagues at the Rotterdam, Austin and Penang sites may also call the Clearline Ethics) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 118 Td (hotline, which offers international call-back on request.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 93 Td (5. Confidentiality and anonymity) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 71 Td (We hope you will feel able to raise concerns openly. If you ask us to keep your identity) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 58 Td (confidential, we will not disclose it without your consent unless required by law. Anonymous) Tj ET
endstream
