6 0 obj
<< /Length 2180 >>
stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (reports will be considered, but they can be harder to investigate because we cannot ask) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 716 Td (follow-up questions.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 691 Td (6. What happens next) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 669 Td (1. The Company Secretary will acknowledge your concern within 7 days of receipt.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 656 Td (2. An initial assessment will determine whether an investigation is needed and who should) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 643 Td (   carry it out.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 630 Td (3. You may be asked to attend a meeting to provide further information. You may bring a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 617 Td (   colleague or trade union representative.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 604 Td (4. We aim to give you feedback on the outcome within 3 months, although we may not be able to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 591 Td (   share full details for reasons of confidentiality.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 575 Td (7. Protection and support) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 553 Td (No one who raises a genuine concern will suffer any detriment as a result, even if the concern) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 540 Td (turns out to be mistaken. Anyone found to have victimised or retaliated against a whistleblower) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 527 Td (will face disciplinary action. Deliberately making false allegations is also a disciplinary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 514 Td (matter.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 489 Td (8. External disclosures) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 467 Td (The aim of this policy is to provide an internal mechanism for reporting and investigating) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 454 Td (wrongdoing. In some circumstances the law recognises that it may be appropriate to report) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 441 Td (concerns to an external body, such as a regulator. We strongly encourage you to seek advice) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 428 Td (before reporting a concern externally.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 403 Td (9. Responsibility and review) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 381 Td (The Company Secretary has overall responsibility for this policy and reports whistleblowing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 368 Td (statistics to the Audit Committee twice a year. This policy will be reviewed every three years.) Tj ET
endstream
